But</span> <span begin="00:14.103" end="00:14.358">they'd</span> <span begin="00:14.358" end="00:15.475">already</span> <span begin="00:15.475" end="00:15.798">picked</span> <span begin="00:15.798" end="00:16.112">out</span> <span begin="00:16.112" end="00:16.680">your</span> <span begin="00:16.998" end="00:17.778">grave</span> <span begin="00:18.018" end="00:18.303">and</span> <span begin="00:18.303" end="00:19.052">hearse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可早已有人 暗中为你选好坟墓与灵车</span></p><p begin="00:19.270" end="00:23.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:19.270" end="00:19.607">Be</span><span begin="00:19.607" end="00:19.955">ware</span> <span begin="00:19.955" end="00:20.236">the</span> <span begin="00:20.236" end="00:20.592">wrath</span> <span begin="00:20.592" end="00:20.925">of</span> <span begin="00:20.925" end="00:21.300">masked</span> <span begin="00:21.300" end="00:21.461">cru</span><span begin="00:21.461" end="00:22.285">sa</span><span begin="00:22.285" end="00:23.794">ders</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当心那伪善征讨者的重重怒火</span></p><p begin="00:23.844" end="00:26.368" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:23.844" end="00:24.038">Did</span> <span begin="00:24.038" end="00:24.224">you</span> <span begin="00:24.224" end="00:24.544">girl-</span><span begin="00:24.544" end="00:24.892">boss</span> <span begin="00:24.892" end="00:25.171">too</span> <span begin="00:25.171" end="00:25.465">close</span> <span begin="00:25.465" end="00:25.656">to</span> <span begin="00:25.656" end="00:25.859">the</span> <span begin="00:25.859" end="00:26.368">sun?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这位精英女性 你是否太过锋芒毕露</span></p><p begin="00:26.542" end="00:28.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:26.542" end="00:26.724">Did</span> <span begin="00:26.724" end="00:26.876">they</span> <span begin="00:26.876" end="00:27.016">catch</span> <span begin="00:27.016" end="00:27.237">you</span> <span begin="00:27.237" end="00:27.537">having</span> <span begin="00:27.537" end="00:27.771">far</span> <span begin="00:27.771" end="00:28.078">too</span> <span begin="00:28.078" end="00:28.473">much</span> <span begin="00:28.473" end="00:28.869">fun?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是否太过恣意玩乐 而被人盯上</span></p><p begin="00:29.149" end="00:31.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:29.149" end="00:29.363">Come</span> <span begin="00:29.363" end="00:29.527">with</span> <span begin="00:29.527" end="00:29.761">me,</span> <span begin="00:29.761" end="00:29.998">when</span> <span begin="00:29.998" end="00:30.201">they</span> <span begin="00:30.201" end="00:30.401">see</span> <span begin="00:30.401" end="00:30.761">us,</span> <span begin="00:30.761" end="00:31.097">they'll</span> <span begin="00:31.097" end="00:31.820">run</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">跟我来 见到我们 敌人自会仓皇逃窜</span></p><p begin="00:31.989" end="00:34.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:31.989" end="00:32.341">Some</span><span begin="00:32.341" end="00:32.684">thing</span> <span begin="00:32.784" end="00:33.325">wicked</span> <span begin="00:33.496" end="00:33.801">this</span> <span begin="00:33.801" end="00:34.120">way</span> <span begin="00:34.120" end="00:34.655">comes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不祥之兆 步步紧逼</span></p><p begin="00:34.796" end="00:38.991" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:34.796" end="00:35.437">Good</span> <span begin="00:35.437" end="00:35.765">thing</span> <span begin="00:35.765" end="00:36.044">I</span> <span begin="00:36.044" end="00:36.391">like</span> <span begin="00:36.391" end="00:36.735">my</span> <span begin="00:36.735" end="00:37.336">friends</span> <span begin="00:37.336" end="00:38.991">cancelled</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">幸好我偏爱被世人唾弃的同伴</span></p><p begin="00:39.754" end="00:43.758" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:39.754" end="00:40.037">I</span> <span begin="00:40.037" end="00:40.355">like</span> <span begin="00:40.355" end="00:40.695">'em</span> <span begin="00:40.695" end="00:41.008">cloaked</span> <span begin="00:41.008" end="00:41.337">in</span> <span begin="00:41.337" end="00:41.948">Gucci</span> <span begin="00:41.948" end="00:42.294">and</span> <span begin="00:42.294" end="00:42.500">in</span> <span begin="00:42.500" end="00:43.758">scandal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我爱他们身披古驰 深陷丑闻的模样</span></p><p begin="00:43.977" end="00:45.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:43.977" end="00:44.301">Like</span> <span begin="00:44.301" end="00:44.672">my</span> <span begin="00:44.672" end="00:45.338">whiskey</span> <span begin="00:45.338" end="00:45.930">sour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如钟爱我的威士忌酸酒</span></p><p begin="00:46.283" end="00:48.821" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:46.283" end="00:46.592">And</span> <span begin="00:46.592" end="00:47.302">poison</span> <span begin="00:47.302" end="00:47.911">thorny</span> <span begin="00:47.911" end="00:48.821">flowers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如欣赏多刺的蛇蝎之花</span></p><p begin="00:49.318" end="00:51.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:49.318" end="00:49.941">Welcome</span> <span begin="00:49.941" end="00:50.261">to</span> <span begin="00:50.261" end="00:50.604">my</span> <span begin="00:50.604" end="00:51.481">underworld</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">欢迎来到我的暗黑国度</span></p><p begin="00:51.569" end="00:53.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:51.569" end="00:51.746">Where</span> <span begin="00:51.746" end="00:51.905">it</span> <span begin="00:51.905" end="00:52.202">gets</span> <span begin="00:52.202" end="00:52.552">quite</span> <span begin="00:52.552" end="00:53.085">dark</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这儿夜色深沉 光线黯淡</span></p><p begin="00:53.085" end="00:58.151" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:53.085" end="00:53.254">At</span> <span begin="00:53.254" end="00:53.576">least</span> <span begin="00:53.576" end="00:53.908">you</span> <span begin="00:53.908" end="00:54.174">know</span> <span begin="00:54.174" end="00:55.228">exactly</span> <span begin="00:55.228" end="00:55.546">who</span> <span begin="00:55.546" end="00:55.846">your</span> <span begin="00:55.846" end="00:56.545">friends</span> <span begin="00:56.545" end="00:58.151">are</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可至少你能看清 谁才是真朋友</span></p><p begin="00:59.165" end="01:02.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:59.165" end="00:59.501">They're</span> <span begin="00:59.501" end="00:59.847">the</span> <span begin="00:59.847" end="01:00.194">ones</span> <span begin="01:00.194" end="01:00.453">with</span> <span begin="01:00.453" end="01:01.145">matching</span> <span begin="01:01.145" end="01:02.621">scars</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">正是与你共有相似伤疤的人</span></p><p begin="01:03.994" end="01:09.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:03.994" end="01:04.259">It's</span> <span begin="01:04.259" end="01:04.830">easy</span> <span begin="01:04.830" end="01:05.100">to</span> <span begin="01:05.100" end="01:05.430">love</span> <span begin="01:05.430" end="01:05.750">you</span> <span begin="01:05.750" end="01:06.062">when</span> <span begin="01:06.062" end="01:06.664">you're</span> <span begin="01:07.104" end="01:07.774">po</span><span begin="01:08.081" end="01:08.392">pu</span><span begin="01:08.392" end="01:09.068">lar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若有众星捧月的名誉 受人爱慕便轻而易举</span></p><p begin="01:09.382" end="01:14.385" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:09.382" end="01:09.739">The</span> <span begin="01:09.739" end="01:10.402">optics</span> <span begin="01:10.402" end="01:10.746">click,</span> <span begin="01:10.746" end="01:11.822">everyone</span> <span begin="01:12.430" end="01:13.133">pro</spa